Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### REVOTE ROLE FROM USER
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/role/1/4
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GET ALL ROLES
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/role/all
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### SAVE ROLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/role
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name" : "USER"
}

### GET ROLE BY ID
